          "quote": "吃奶越来越费力、呼吸明显变快...嘴唇持续发紫、精神变差、体重不涨...如果出现这些情况才需要马上就诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided a clear, specific set of newborn emergency thresholds including respiratory distress, cyanosis, poor feeding, lethargy, and later detailed jaundice escalation criteria, separating them from routine follow-up items. Met.",
