    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00109",
          "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes hepatitis B immunoglobulin from hepatitis B vaccine, and provides specific guidance on confirming status.",
          "quote": "乙肝免疫球蛋白已经确认打了就没问题，乙肝疫苗第一针和卡介苗一般和免疫球蛋白是在出生后12小时内一起接种的"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly distinguished hepatitis B immunoglobulin from vaccine, checked the status of all four required items (HBV, BCG, metabolic screening, hearing screening), and provided executable instructions for confirmation and completion. Met.",
